09:55.849 --> 09:59.067
looking to move into the authority to move into a closed session,

10:00.867 --> 10:04.509
and I'll just read them out here for you. It's titled Comprehensive

10:05.009 --> 10:07.973
Zoning Bylaw Appeals: The Ontario Land Tribunal Update,

10:08.618 --> 10:10.487
and that's as per Section 239,

10:12.484 --> 10:16.606
litigation or potential litigation including matters before administrative tribunals

10:16.654 --> 10:20.059
affecting the municipality or local board and advice that is

10:20.559 --> 10:23.778
subject to solicitor-client privilege, including communications necessary

10:24.278 --> 10:27.772
for that purpose. And that is the only

10:27.886 --> 10:31.193
item that we're looking to discuss. So,

10:31.418 --> 10:35.378
first of all, any disclosure of pecuniary interest or any general nature thereof

10:35.878 --> 10:39.523
on that item before we move into closed? Not hearing

10:39.619 --> 10:42.803
or seeing anyone. Would someone be willing to move to go into

10:42.851 --> 10:45.713
closed for me? I got alt on screen,

10:45.745 --> 10:49.365
Bucettil here in the room. And anything more before

10:49.865 --> 10:53.669
I call the vote on that? No? Okay. Is there anyone against

10:54.169 --> 10:57.602
