11:07.864 --> 11:08.421
Thank you so much.

01:09:12.728 --> 01:09:13.244
All right,

01:09:15.646 --> 01:09:19.224
good evening everybody. Hope everyone's doing well.

01:09:20.062 --> 01:09:23.447
To my colleagues online, if you don't mind throwing your

