03:32:18.425 --> 03:32:21.635
what you're looking for out of the report. Okay, go right ahead. Perfect.

03:32:21.780 --> 03:32:25.375
Thank you. Hi, everyone. My name is Jeremiah Vander Laan.

03:32:25.552 --> 03:32:29.100
I'm with Kiwi Newton. The plan design builder for the project.

03:32:29.341 --> 03:32:33.515
And yeah, you may remember me from the public meeting where

03:32:34.015 --> 03:32:36.968
I probably took up too much of everyone's time, so I'll keep it short today.

03:32:37.770 --> 03:32:42.106
Basically, all I want to say is that Kiwi as, as an employer

03:32:42.347 --> 03:32:46.104
here in Guelph experiences challenges attracting and

03:32:46.604 --> 03:32:49.540
retaining skilled employees, and a big part of that is housing.

03:32:50.054 --> 03:32:53.506
So housing affects where people work, It affects

03:32:54.006 --> 03:32:57.376
whether businesses can attract people and whether they can keep them.

03:32:58.002 --> 03:33:01.647
So this project not only provides more housing for

03:33:01.855 --> 03:33:05.532
employers of Guelph businesses, but the project itself will

03:33:05.613 --> 03:33:08.760
also be built by a Guelph design-build team,

03:33:09.081 --> 03:33:12.019
including many local subcontractors and professionals.

03:33:12.678 --> 03:33:16.355
So, excuse me, for us, housing and economic development are very

03:33:16.371 --> 03:33:20.530
