03:33:20.562 --> 03:33:23.436
moving forward, and that's all the time I'm going to take today.

03:33:24.335 --> 03:33:28.012
Thank you, Jeremiah, we appreciate that. And let me see if there's any questions

03:33:28.512 --> 03:33:30.485
as a follow-up. Is there any from my colleagues?

03:33:31.817 --> 03:33:34.916
Seeing none, but again, thank you so much, we appreciate it.

03:33:35.639 --> 03:33:39.284
Thank you. All right, and, uh, Sean Scott

03:33:39.332 --> 03:33:42.575
