03:33:43.185 --> 03:33:44.068
also by video.

03:34:02.327 --> 03:34:04.842
Hello, Shawn, it's Mayor Guthrie. You can hear me okay?

03:34:06.036 --> 03:34:09.793
Excellent, yes, I've been following along as well. All right, well,

03:34:09.875 --> 03:34:13.386
thank you so much for joining us, Shawn, and thanks for waiting. And I'll turn

03:34:13.434 --> 03:34:16.965
the microphone over to you. We can hear you fine, go right ahead. Thank you,

03:34:17.671 --> 03:34:21.153
