03:35:03.052 --> 03:35:06.773
Sandeep talked about passionately wanting to one

03:35:06.805 --> 03:35:10.090
day own a home and, and contribute to

03:35:10.590 --> 03:35:13.856
that. They both share a common aspiration to own a home in

03:35:14.356 --> 03:35:17.958
the community they work in, that they contribute to, and to build a future

03:35:18.038 --> 03:35:22.156
here. Today, that aspiration continues

03:35:22.188 --> 03:35:25.377
to be a challenge for both of those employees and

03:35:25.877 --> 03:35:29.592
many employees of Linamar. There are obviously each day the cost

03:35:29.656 --> 03:35:32.817
