4 delegations that have signed

04:53:03.714 --> 04:53:07.474
up. And so we're going to start with—

04:53:07.635 --> 04:53:10.161
is it Jorn or Yorn? I'm sorry if I'm saying that wrong. I think it's

04:53:10.661 --> 04:53:15.427
Jorn Christensen, who I believe is here in person. But I— are

04:53:15.476 --> 04:53:15.753
you here?

04:53:20.201 --> 04:53:22.788
Okay, yep, come on down whenever you're able.

04:53:37.447 --> 04:53:40.658
And thank you so much for coming and for waiting as well.

04:53:42.023 --> 04:53:45.395
