05:42:54.601 --> 05:42:58.041
the concept that comes forward at site plan matches what you see here tonight zoning,

05:42:58.540 --> 05:43:02.035
you know, much of that could be completely reusable. But at

05:43:02.535 --> 05:43:06.094
the time of zoning, it's on city's engineering staff to ensure that we are demonstrating

05:43:06.207 --> 05:43:10.113
to city council that zoning for municipal

05:43:10.145 --> 05:43:13.712
services is adequate and available. Okay. All right.

05:43:13.938 --> 05:43:17.343
